# Groupon

> Groupon is a local-commerce marketplace where people discover and book discounted experiences, services, products, and travel — things to do, food & drink, beauty & spas, health & fitness, home and auto services, retail goods, getaways, and retailer coupons. Founded in Chicago in 2008, Groupon connects customers with deals from local merchants and brands; members can earn Groupon Bucks credit toward future purchases.

> Deals are time-limited and inventory changes daily — the live deal or category page is always the source of truth for current price, availability, and terms.

